            "metadata": {
                "category": "void_inpainting",
                "description": "Removes a masked object from a video using Netflix's VOID model. Takes a binary mask of the object and an optional mask of physically-affected regions, builds the VOID quadmask internally, runs Pass 1 inpainting, and optionally runs Pass 2 warped-noise refinement for improved temporal consistency.",
